Lighthouse Technologies
About

Engineering and Technology Company Specializing in Telecommunications and Electrical Infrastructure

Lighthouse Technologies is an engineering, technology, and project delivery company based in Charlotte, NC, with deep expertise in telecommunications and electrical infrastructure across the continental United States.

We partner with clients to plan, design, and build the networks of tomorrow. From early-stage planning and engineering to final deployment and closeout, our team brings the experience and tools necessary to deliver complex projects on time and on budget.

Our team includes licensed engineers, field technicians, project managers, and GIS specialists working together to serve ISPs, carriers, utilities, and municipalities.

Our core capabilities include:

OSP Fiber Network Design (FTTH, FTTB, Backbone/Long-Haul)
Permit Coordination and Municipal Approvals
Construction Management and Oversight
GIS Data Collection and Management
Network Audits and As-Built Documentation
Electrical Infrastructure Design and Support

We work across a wide range of project types including BEAD-funded deployments, municipal fiber buildouts, carrier expansions, and utility grid modernization.

