Lighthouse Technologies
Services

Our Services

Lighthouse Technologies offers a comprehensive range of engineering and technology services to clients in telecommunications, utilities, and municipal markets.

OSP Fiber Network Design
End-to-end outside plant fiber network design including route planning, fiber distribution, splice planning, and network architecture for FTTH, FTTB, and backbone networks.

Permit Coordination and Municipal Approvals
Management of permit applications, coordination with local government agencies, utility companies, and stakeholders to obtain necessary approvals for construction activities.

Construction Management
Oversight and management of fiber construction projects, including contractor coordination, schedule management, quality control, and stakeholder communication.

GIS Data Collection and Management
Comprehensive geospatial data services including field data collection, GIS database management, aerial/underground network mapping, and spatial analysis.

Network Audits and As-Built Documentation
Post-construction network verification, documentation of as-built conditions, and database reconciliation to ensure accurate records for network management.

Electrical Infrastructure Design
Engineering design services for electrical infrastructure including substation design, distribution systems, and grid modernization projects.

